/**
 * The minimal events page (A36, "渲染消毒"): no-build static HTML + vanilla
 * JS/CSS served as string templates. There is no bundler, no framework and
 * no external asset — everything is generated by this module.
 *
 * Security posture of the served code:
 * - EVERY dynamic text passes `escapeHtml` (the SAME algorithm as
 *   src/sanitize.ts, embedded client-side) BEFORE it is concatenated into
 *   the DOM string. Hostile log samples (`<script>`, `<img onerror=...>`,
 *   fake secrets) become inert character references.
 * - The page pipeline strips ANSI escapes before escaping
 *   (`sanitizeDisplayText` semantics, mirrored client-side).
 * - The token is entered by the local operator (it lives in a user-only
 *   file; it is never placed in URLs and never injected into the HTML) and
 *   kept in a page-local variable only.
 * - The server adds a strict CSP (`default-src 'none'; script-src 'self';
 *   style-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'`), so even a hypothetical escaping
 *   miss has no inline-script or external-resource surface.
 *
 * M5-01 adds the DAG canvas to the same assets: the run graph renders as ONE
 * inline-SVG string (node boxes, dependency edges, state classes — no canvas
 * 2D, no external library), clicking an editable node opens a form whose
 * field set is role / objective / dependencies ONLY. `buildNodeEditPayload`
 * is the UI layer of the A02 three-layer rejection: any field outside its
 * allowlist (model/profile/...) is refused in the browser and never becomes
 * a request field. Non-editable nodes (anything but PENDING/READY/BLOCKED,
 * A38) render a locked notice instead of a form. Edits POST through the
 * session-bound CSRF token (fetched from GET /api/v1/session) and a 409
 * conflict surfaces as a reload prompt, never as a silent retry.
 *
 * M5-02 adds the controlled-expansion panel: pending Proposals (failed
 * review triggers) render with their findings (为什么 fail), the deterministic
 * nodes an accepted request would mint, the requesting-role selector (A04 —
 * the acting role's canCreateSubtasks is enforced server-side and every
 * denial is audited) and the node/depth budget headroom. An unresolved A20
 * hold renders an explicit "等待用户处理" banner. Every refusal — 403
 * permission, 409 revision conflict with the server's current revision,
 * 409 rounds exhausted — surfaces as explicit status text, never a silent
 * overwrite. `buildExpansionRequestPayload` keeps the same allowlist
 * discipline as the edit payload builder (no model/Profile field anywhere).
 *
 * M5-03 adds three read-mostly panels fed by the new API routes, all with the
 * SAME sanitization contract (every dynamic value reaches the DOM through
 * esc(...)):
 * - 审批面板 (A17): each approval card shows EVERY actionDigest constituent
 *   before a decision — the complete argv, the target/base SHA, the repo
 *   root, cwd, frozen profile revision, the DERIVED permission increments,
 *   dimensions/writeScope, required capabilities, risk grade + reasons and
 *   the expiry. Approve/reject addresses exactly ONE actionDigest
 *   (data-approval-id + data-approval-digest on each decision form). A
 *   candidate-changed / expired / already-decided approval renders an
 *   explicit 已失效 badge with NO approve affordance. The global-grant
 *   vocabulary ("全部允许", "信任此站点") appears NOWHERE — pinned by tests
 *   via the FORBIDDEN_UI_PHRASES list.
 * - diff 面板 (A12): the git-sourced unified diff of the integrated candidate
 *   vs the baseline, rendered as inert escaped text inside <pre>, plus the
 *   A12 verdict binding state: a candidate change shows 已失效 (never an old
 *   pass), valid bindings show the verdict for THIS candidateSha.
 * - 上下文面板: the context bundle fragment inventory — layer, trust class,
 *   source provenance, byte size and the truncation marker — with the
 *   traceFragment "why is this here" record.
 *
 * M9-02 turns the page's DEFAULT face into the task workbench ("打开即是
 * 工作台"): a tab bar splits the page into 工作台 (default) and 高级
 * (observatory — every M5 surface above, unchanged, same ids). The workbench
 * tab carries:
 * - 新建任务 form: objective textarea, profile select fed by
 *   GET /api/v1/profiles, projectDir input whose hint is EXPERIENCE-ONLY
 *   (the page cannot stat the filesystem; existence/directory/git-baseline
 *   validation is the backend's fail-closed job, its typed 400 codes surface
 *   verbatim via createRunFailureText). The body is built by
 *   buildRunCreatePayload from an EXPLICIT allowlist (objective/profileId/
 *   projectDir) — the UI layer of the A02 rejection, mirroring
 *   buildNodeEditPayload. Creation POSTs through the session token + the
 *   session-bound CSRF token and renders the 202 accept state ("queued").
 * - 任务列表: GET /api/v1/runs on a 2s poll (auto-refresh toggle + manual
 *   refresh), newest first, each row a status badge (the durable status plus
 *   a plain-Chinese gloss) + objective + createdAt, ALL escaped.
 * - 任务详情/实时进度: clicking a row expands a detail area — the run's
 *   executions through the EXISTING runDetailHtml renderer, a failure note
 *   that never mistakes a RUNNING run for healthy (the vocabulary has no
 *   failed status; failed executions are called out explicitly), and the
 *   live event stream: ONE WebSocket per execution to /api/v1/events/live
 *   (first-message auth with the same session token, subscribe frame,
 *   client-side eventId dedup per A39), appended through the SAME eventToHtml
 *   esc path. The detail area is a stable skeleton so poll re-renders never
 *   clobber the live event list.
 *
 * M9-03 adds the third tab, 配置（profiles）: the maintainer's profiles
 * config-file surface. It loads GET /api/v1/profiles/full (source path +
 * current full text + parse result through the EXISTING frozen parser),
 * renders the parsed summary (CLI mapping + budget) and a textarea editor,
 * and PUTs the FULL text back — validated server-side by the same parser,
 * written atomically (temp file + rename). A 422 refusal leaves the file
 * untouched and the editor content intact; a 409 PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT
 * renders the honest 壳未接线/未传 --profiles guidance (shell did not pass
 * --profiles) instead of any guessed path. The page states plainly that a
 * write-back does not hot-reload the running process.
 */

const CSP_COMMENT = "see server.ts: strict CSP, no inline script, no external origins";

function staticIndexHtml(): string {
  return `<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'">
<title>role-orchestrator — 任务工作台</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/app.css">
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>role-orchestrator 任务工作台</h1>
  <p class="hint">会话令牌保存在仅当前用户可读的令牌文件中；本页不会把它写入 URL 或页面源码。</p>
  <section id="connect">
    <label for="token-input">会话令牌</label>
    <input id="token-input" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
    <label for="execution-input">执行 ID</label>
    <input id="execution-input" type="text" value="exec-node-1" spellcheck="false">
    <button id="load-button" type="button">加载执行与事件</button>
    <span id="status" role="status"></span>
  </section>
  <nav id="page-tabs" aria-label="页面切换">
    <button id="tab-workbench" type="button" class="tab-button tab-active">工作台</button>
    <button id="tab-config" type="button" class="tab-button">配置（profiles）</button>
    <button id="tab-advanced" type="button" class="tab-button">高级（观测台）</button>
  </nav>
  <div id="tab-workbench-page">
    <section id="workbench-create">
      <h2>新建任务</h2>
      <p class="hint">objective 1..10000 字符且不可全空白；profile 来自本进程加载的 profiles；工作目录必须是绝对路径、已存在且为 git 仓库。前端提示只是体验层——存在性/目录/git 基线校验由后端 fail-closed 执行（400 携带具体原因，拒绝时不落任何库）。</p>
      <form id="create-run-form">
        <label for="objective-input">任务目标（objective）</label>
        <textarea id="objective-input" maxlength="10000" rows="4" spellcheck="false"></textarea>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="profile-select">执行 profile</label>
          <select id="profile-select"><option value="">（尚未载入 profiles）</option></select>
          <button id="load-profiles-button" type="button">载入可用 profiles</button>
        </div>
        <label for="projectdir-input">工作目录（绝对路径，git 仓库）</label>
        <input id="projectdir-input" type="text" spellcheck="false">
        <span id="projectdir-hint" class="hint" role="status"></span>
        <button type="submit">创建任务</button>
        <span id="create-status" role="status"></span>
      </form>
    </section>
    <section id="workbench-list">
      <h2>任务列表</h2>
      <p class="hint">按创建时间倒序。点击任务行展开实时进度：执行清单 + 事件流（经 WS /api/v1/events/live 直播，按 eventId 去重）。run 级状态词汇表无失败值——失败证据在执行 phase 与事件里，展开行会明确标注。</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <label class="auto-refresh"><input type="checkbox" id="auto-refresh-toggle" checked> 自动刷新（2 秒）</label>
        <button id="refresh-runs-button" type="button">刷新列表</button>
      </div>
      <div id="run-list-panel"></div>
    </section>
    <section id="workbench-detail" hidden></section>
  </div>
  <div id="tab-config-page" hidden>
    <section id="profiles-config">
      <h2>profiles 配置（全文查看与原子写回）</h2>
      <p class="hint">本页查看并写回 serve 启动时 <code>--profiles</code> 指向的配置文件全文（严格 JSON，冻结 ProfilesFileSchema；config/profiles.example.yaml 是人工参考）。写回经既有解析器校验后以「临时文件 + rename」原子落盘——校验失败(422)原文件一字不动；本进程不热重载，写回在重启 serve 后生效（同 id 不同定义的 run 创建将 409，漂移是显式的人的决定）。</p>
      <p class="hint">壳未接线（未传 --profiles）时本页显示引导，接口以 409 PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT 诚实拒绝；不存在任何「猜测一个路径来写」的回退。</p>
      <div class="form-row">
        <button id="load-profiles-full-button" type="button">载入当前配置</button>
        <span id="profiles-full-status" role="status"></span>
      </div>
      <div id="profiles-full-panel"></div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <div id="tab-advanced-page" hidden>
    <section id="run-detail" hidden></section>
    <section id="events" hidden></section>
    <section id="dag">
      <h2>任务图（DAG）</h2>
      <p class="hint">图数据带 graphRevision 乐观锁；仅 PENDING / READY / BLOCKED 节点可编辑，运行中或已结束节点不可原地修改（A38）。节点编辑不提供也无法提交 model/Profile 覆盖（A02）；编辑只落库为新 revision，不会触发执行。</p>
      <label for="run-graph-input">运行 ID</label>
      <input id="run-graph-input" type="text" value="run-1" spellcheck="false">
      <button id="load-graph-button" type="button">加载任务图</button>
    </section>
    <section id="graph-canvas" hidden></section>
    <section id="node-editor" hidden></section>
    <section id="expansions">
      <h2>动态扩图（Proposal）</h2>
      <p class="hint">review fail 触发的扩图走受控协议：先校验发起角色的子任务权限（A04，拒绝原因写入审计），再校验 graphRevision 乐观锁（A38，过时请求返回 409 并附当前 revision，绝不静默覆盖），扩图本体复用三轮封顶、user hold 与无环复验（A20）。预算上限：每运行 64 节点 / 依赖深度 16。扩图不提供也无法提交 model/Profile 覆盖（A02）。</p>
      <p class="hint">与任务图共用上方“运行 ID”。</p>
      <button id="load-expansions-button" type="button">加载扩图状态</button>
    </section>
    <section id="expansion-panel" hidden></section>
    <section id="approvals">
      <h2>审批（A17）</h2>
      <p class="hint">审批只对单个 actionDigest 生效：每张卡片在决策前展示完整动作要素（argv、目标 SHA、基线、权限增量、风险等级、过期时间等）。候选 SHA 已变化、已过期或已决定的审批显示「已失效」且不可批准；批准与拒绝只针对该审批绑定的那一个动作。本页不存在任何全局放权操作 —— 没有批量批准，没有站点级信任授予，也永远不会出现一键授权全部动作的按钮。</p>
      <p class="hint">与任务图共用上方“运行 ID”。</p>
      <button id="load-approvals-button" type="button">加载审批</button>
    </section>
    <section id="approval-panel" hidden></section>
    <section id="diff">
      <h2>候选 diff 与审查绑定（A12）</h2>
      <p class="hint">候选 diff 是集成分支相对基线的文件变更（数据来自 git，只读展示，转义后渲染）。candidateSha 变化后旧审查结果显示「已失效」而非旧 pass（A12）；pass/fail/blocked 只对绑定的那一个候选 SHA 有效。</p>
      <label for="diff-node-input">节点 ID</label>
      <input id="diff-node-input" type="text" value="node-1" spellcheck="false">
      <button id="load-diff-button" type="button">加载候选 diff</button>
    </section>
    <section id="diff-panel" hidden></section>
    <section id="contexts">
      <h2>上下文清单</h2>
      <p class="hint">展示 context bundle 的片段清单：层级（project_rule &gt; role &gt; task &gt; dependency &gt; memory）、来源、trust 类别与截断标记（超出字节预算的片段带 omittedReason，绝不静默丢弃），以及每条片段的入选追溯（traceFragment）。memory 内容始终是 untrusted-content 数据，不构成权限或角色绑定（A16）。</p>
      <p class="hint">与任务图共用上方“运行 ID”。</p>
      <button id="load-contexts-button" type="button">加载上下文清单</button>
    </section>
    <section id="context-panel" hidden></section>
  </div>
</main>
<script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
`;
}

/**
 * The client script. Its DOM wiring is guarded by `typeof document`, so the
 * tests can evaluate it inside `node:vm` and call the pure rendering
 * functions directly. IMPORTANT for reviewers: every `${...}` interpolation
 * below that carries event data goes through `esc(...)` first.
 */
function staticAppJs(): string {
  return `/* role-orchestrator events page (${CSP_COMMENT}). */
"use strict";
(function () {
  var ESCAPE_TABLE = { "&": "&amp;", "<": "&lt;", ">": "&gt;", '"': "&quot;", "'": "&#39;", "\`": "&#96;", "=": "&#61;" };

  function escapeHtml(text) {
    return String(text).replace(/[&<>"'\`=]/g, function (char) { return ESCAPE_TABLE[char] || char; });
  }

  function stripAnsiEscapes(text) {
    return String(text).replace(/\\u001b(?:\\[[0-?]*[ -/]*[@-~]|[@-Z\\\\-_])|\\u009b[0-?]*[ -/]*[@-~]/g, "");
  }

  /* The ONLY sanctioned path from event data to DOM HTML: strip escapes,
   * then escape. Every interpolation in renderEvents goes through this. */
  function esc(text) {
    return escapeHtml(stripAnsiEscapes(text));
  }

  function eventToHtml(event) {
    var payloadSummary = "";
    if (event.payload && typeof event.payload === "object") {
      if (typeof event.payload.summary === "string") payloadSummary = event.payload.summary;
      else if (typeof event.payload.error === "string") payloadSummary = event.payload.error;
      else if (typeof event.payload.message === "string") payloadSummary = event.payload.message;
    }
    return '<li class="event">' +
      '<span class="seq">#' + esc(event.seq) + '</span> ' +
      '<span class="type">' + esc(event.type) + '</span> ' +
      '<time>' + esc(event.occurredAt) + '</time>' +
      '<div class="payload">' + esc(payloadSummary) + '</div>' +
      '</li>';
  }

  /* Renders events into ONE escaped HTML string and assigns it once; the
   * tests assert the produced string contains no live script surface. */
  function renderEvents(container, events) {
    var items = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < events.length; i++) items.push(eventToHtml(events[i]));
    container.innerHTML = '<ul class="events">' + items.join("") + '</ul>';
    container.hidden = events.length === 0;
  }

  /* Pure string builder for the run-detail block (M9-02: reused inside the
   * workbench detail card). Same escaping contract as everywhere else. */
  function runDetailHtml(detail) {
    var rows = [];
    var executions = detail.executions || [];
    for (var i = 0; i < executions.length; i++) {
      var execution = executions[i];
      rows.push('<li>' + esc(execution.id) + ' — ' + esc(execution.phase) +
        ' (attempt ' + esc(execution.attempt) + ', pid ' + esc(execution.pid === null ? "-" : execution.pid) + ')</li>');
    }
    return '<h2>' + esc(detail.taskId) + '</h2>' +
      '<p>run ' + esc(detail.id) + ' · status ' + esc(detail.status) + ' · baseSha ' + esc(detail.baseSha) + '</p>' +
      '<ul>' + rows.join("") + '</ul>';
  }

  function renderRunDetail(container, detail) {
    container.innerHTML = runDetailHtml(detail);
    container.hidden = false;
  }

  function setStatus(text) {
    var status = document.getElementById("status");
    if (status !== null) status.textContent = text; /* textContent: no HTML parsing at all */
  }

  /* ---- M5-01: DAG canvas (inline SVG) + guarded node editor --------------
   * Same sanitization contract as above: EVERY dynamic value reaches the DOM
   * through esc(...). The canvas is one SVG string; the editor form is plain
   * HTML. There is deliberately NO model/Profile field anywhere: the payload
   * builder (buildNodeEditPayload) refuses any field outside its allowlist
   * (the UI layer of the A02 three-layer rejection), and the API + contracts
   * schemas refuse carriers again server-side. Editable states mirror the
   * server: PENDING / READY / BLOCKED only (A38). */

  var EDIT_FIELD_ALLOWLIST = ["role", "objective", "dependencies"];
  var ROLE_OPTIONS = ["coordinator", "architect", "developer", "reviewer"];
  var EDITABLE_NODE_STATES = { PENDING: true, READY: true, BLOCKED: true };

  function isNodeEditable(node) {
    return node !== null && typeof node === "object" && EDITABLE_NODE_STATES[node.state] === true;
  }

  /* UI-layer A02 gate: the edit body is built from an EXPLICIT allowlist. Any
   * other field name is refused here — it never becomes a request field. */
  function buildNodeEditPayload(nodeId, expectedGraphRevision, fields) {
    var keys = Object.keys(fields || {});
    for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
      if (EDIT_FIELD_ALLOWLIST.indexOf(keys[i]) === -1) {
        throw new Error('refused field "' + keys[i] + '": node edits accept only role/objective/dependencies; model/Profile overrides are forbidden (A02)');
      }
    }
    if (keys.length === 0) {
      throw new Error("at least one of role/objective/dependencies is required");
    }
    var patch = {};
    if (fields.role !== undefined) patch.role = String(fields.role);
    if (fields.objective !== undefined) patch.objective = String(fields.objective);
    if (fields.dependencies !== undefined) {
      var raw = String(fields.dependencies).split(",");
      var deps = [];
      for (var j = 0; j < raw.length; j++) {
        var dep = raw[j].trim();
        if (dep !== "") deps.push(dep);
      }
      patch.dependencies = deps;
    }
    return { expectedGraphRevision: expectedGraphRevision, nodeId: nodeId, patch: patch };
  }

  /* Deterministic layered layout: layer = longest edge-count path from a root
   * (Kahn, ids sorted within each layer). Validated graphs are acyclic; any
   * leftover (impossible) node lands in a tail layer so none disappear. */
  function computeGraphLayout(nodes) {
    var byId = {};
    var i, j;
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) byId[nodes[i].nodeId] = true;
    var remaining = {};
    var dependents = {};
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      var deps = [];
      var raw = nodes[i].dependencies || [];
      for (j = 0; j < raw.length; j++) {
        if (byId[raw[j]] === true && deps.indexOf(raw[j]) === -1) deps.push(raw[j]);
      }
      remaining[nodes[i].nodeId] = deps.length;
      for (j = 0; j < deps.length; j++) {
        if (!dependents[deps[j]]) dependents[deps[j]] = [];
        dependents[deps[j]].push(nodes[i].nodeId);
      }
    }
    var layer = {};
    var queue = [];
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      if (remaining[nodes[i].nodeId] === 0) {
        layer[nodes[i].nodeId] = 0;
        queue.push(nodes[i].nodeId);
      }
    }
    var head = 0;
    while (head < queue.length) {
      var id = queue[head];
      head++;
      var children = dependents[id] || [];
      for (j = 0; j < children.length; j++) {
        remaining[children[j]] = remaining[children[j]] - 1;
        if (remaining[children[j]] === 0) {
          layer[children[j]] = layer[id] + 1;
          queue.push(children[j]);
        }
      }
    }
    var maxLayer = 0;
    for (var key in layer) {
      if (layer[key] > maxLayer) maxLayer = layer[key];
    }
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      if (layer[nodes[i].nodeId] === undefined) layer[nodes[i].nodeId] = maxLayer + 1;
    }
    return layer;
  }

  /* Render the run graph as ONE inline-SVG string (no canvas 2D, no external
   * library): dependency edges first, then node boxes with id/role/state.
   * State classes (node-state-<STATE>) drive the CSS colors. */
  function renderRunGraph(container, graph) {
    var nodes = graph && graph.nodes ? graph.nodes : [];
    container.hidden = false;
    if (nodes.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p class="hint">该运行没有节点。</p>';
      return;
    }
    var layer = computeGraphLayout(nodes);
    var NW = 180, NH = 68, GX = 96, GY = 26, PAD = 14;
    var columns = [];
    var i, j;
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      var l = layer[nodes[i].nodeId];
      while (columns.length <= l) columns.push([]);
      columns[l].push(nodes[i].nodeId);
    }
    var pos = {};
    var maxRows = 0;
    for (i = 0; i < columns.length; i++) {
      columns[i].sort();
      if (columns[i].length > maxRows) maxRows = columns[i].length;
      for (j = 0; j < columns[i].length; j++) {
        pos[columns[i][j]] = { x: PAD + i * (NW + GX), y: PAD + j * (NH + GY) };
      }
    }
    var width = PAD * 2 + columns.length * NW + (columns.length - 1) * GX;
    var height = PAD * 2 + maxRows * NH + (maxRows - 1) * GY;
    var parts = [];
    parts.push('<svg class="dag-canvas" role="img" aria-label="任务 DAG 画布" width="' + width + '" height="' + height + '" viewBox="0 0 ' + width + ' ' + height + '">');
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      var node = nodes[i];
      var nodeDeps = node.dependencies || [];
      for (j = 0; j < nodeDeps.length; j++) {
        var from = pos[nodeDeps[j]];
        if (!from) continue;
        var to = pos[node.nodeId];
        parts.push('<line class="dag-edge" x1="' + (from.x + NW) + '" y1="' + (from.y + NH / 2) + '" x2="' + to.x + '" y2="' + (to.y + NH / 2) + '"></line>');
      }
    }
    for (i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
      var n = nodes[i];
      var p = pos[n.nodeId];
      var editable = isNodeEditable(n);
      parts.push('<g class="dag-node node-state-' + esc(n.state) + (editable ? ' dag-node-editable' : ' dag-node-locked') + '" data-node-id="' + esc(n.nodeId) + '">');
      parts.push('<rect class="dag-node-box" x="' + p.x + '" y="' + p.y + '" width="' + NW + '" height="' + NH + '" rx="6"></rect>');
      parts.push('<text class="dag-node-id" x="' + (p.x + 10) + '" y="' + (p.y + 22) + '">' + esc(n.nodeId) + '</text>');
      parts.push('<text class="dag-node-role" x="' + (p.x + 10) + '" y="' + (p.y + 40) + '">' + esc(n.role) + '</text>');
      parts.push('<text class="dag-node-state" x="' + (p.x + 10) + '" y="' + (p.y + 57) + '">' + esc(n.state) + (editable ? '' : ' · 锁定') + '</text>');
      parts.push('</g>');
    }
    parts.push('</svg>');
    container.innerHTML = parts.join("");
  }

  /* The node editor: an edit form (role select with EXACTLY the four built-in
   * roles, objective, dependencies) for editable nodes; a typed locked notice
   * for everything else (A38 前半 shown in the UI, enforced again server-side). */
  function renderNodeEditor(container, input) {
    container.hidden = false;
    var node = input && input.node ? input.node : null;
    if (node === null) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p class="hint">请在画布上选择一个节点。</p>';
      return;
    }
    if (!isNodeEditable(node)) {
      container.innerHTML =
        '<div class="editor-locked"><h2>节点 ' + esc(node.nodeId) + '</h2>' +
        '<p>当前状态 ' + esc(node.state) + '：运行中或已结束的节点不可原地修改（A38）。' +
        '如需变更定义，请使用新的任务运行；已有执行证据保持不变。</p></div>';
      return;
    }
    var revision = input.graphRevision;
    var depText = (node.dependencies || []).join(",");
    var options = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < ROLE_OPTIONS.length; i++) {
      var selected = ROLE_OPTIONS[i] === node.role ? ' selected' : '';
      options.push('<option value="' + esc(ROLE_OPTIONS[i]) + '"' + selected + '>' + esc(ROLE_OPTIONS[i]) + '</option>');
    }
    container.innerHTML =
      '<form id="node-edit-form" data-node-id="' + esc(node.nodeId) + '" data-graph-revision="' + esc(revision) + '">' +
      '<h2>编辑节点 ' + esc(node.nodeId) + '</h2>' +
      '<label>角色 <select name="role">' + options.join('') + '</select></label>' +
      '<label>目标 <input name="objective" type="text" maxlength="10000" value="' + esc(node.objective || '') + '"></label>' +
      '<label>依赖（逗号分隔） <input name="dependencies" type="text" value="' + esc(depText) + '"></label>' +
      '<button type="submit">提交编辑</button>' +
      '<span class="editor-status" role="status"></span>' +
      '</form>';
  }

  function fetchJson(path, token) {
    return fetch(path, { headers: { "Authorization": "Bearer " + token } })
      .then(function (response) {
        if (!response.ok) {
          return response.json().catch(function () { return {}; }).then(function (body) {
            var reason = body && body.error && body.error.message ? body.error.message : ("HTTP " + response.status);
            throw new Error(reason);
          });
        }
        return response.json();
      });
  }

  /* ---- M5-02: controlled expansion (Proposal display + A04/A20/A38) -------
   * Same sanitization contract as above: EVERY dynamic value reaches the DOM
   * through esc(...). The proposal card is display-only: submitting goes
   * through the strict payload builder below (allowlist has NO model/Profile
   * field — the UI layer of A02), and every refusal — 403 permission with
   * audited reason, 409 revision conflict carrying the server's current
   * revision, 409 rounds exhausted — surfaces as explicit status text, never
   * a silent overwrite. */

  var EXPANSION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST = ["requesterRoleId", "repairedNodeId"];

  /* UI-layer A02 gate for expansions: the body is built from an EXPLICIT
   * allowlist; any other field name is refused here and never becomes a
   * request field. requesterRoleId is mandatory: the acting role's subtask
   * permission is what the server checks and audits (A04). */
  function buildExpansionRequestPayload(reviewNodeId, candidateSha, expectedGraphRevision, fields) {
    var keys = Object.keys(fields || {});
    for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
      if (EXPANSION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST.indexOf(keys[i]) === -1) {
        throw new Error('refused field "' + keys[i] + '": expansion requests accept only requesterRoleId/repairedNodeId; model/Profile overrides are forbidden (A02)');
      }
    }
    if (!fields || typeof fields.requesterRoleId !== "string" || fields.requesterRoleId === "") {
      throw new Error("requesterRoleId is required: the server checks and audits the acting role's subtask permission (A04)");
    }
    var payload = {
      expectedGraphRevision: expectedGraphRevision,
      reviewNodeId: String(reviewNodeId),
      candidateSha: String(candidateSha),
      requesterRoleId: String(fields.requesterRoleId)
    };
    if (fields.repairedNodeId !== undefined && fields.repairedNodeId !== null && String(fields.repairedNodeId) !== "") {
      payload.repairedNodeId = String(fields.repairedNodeId);
    }
    return payload;
  }

  /* Explicit refusal text per typed server code. The 409 branch names the
   * server's currentGraphRevision and states the request was DISCARDED (no
   * silent overwrite) — reload and retry against the current revision. */
  function expansionRequestFailureText(error) {
    var code = error && error.code ? String(error.code) : "";
    var status = error && error.status ? Number(error.status) : 0;
    var message = error && error.message ? String(error.message) : "未知错误";
    if (status === 403 && code === "EXPANSION_PERMISSION_DENIED") {
      return "拒绝（403）：该角色的子任务权限未开放，不能发起扩图（A04）；拒绝原因已写入扩图审计。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 403) {
      return "拒绝（403）：不得通过扩图提交 model/Profile 覆盖（A02）。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 409 && code === "GRAPH_REVISION_CONFLICT") {
      var current = error && error.currentGraphRevision !== undefined && error.currentGraphRevision !== null
        ? String(error.currentGraphRevision)
        : null;
      return "冲突（409）：任务图已被其他修改更新（当前 revision " + (current === null ? "未知" : current) +
        "）。本次请求已被丢弃，不会静默覆盖 —— 请重新加载任务图后基于最新 revision 重试（A38）。";
    }
    if (status === 409 && code === "REVIEW_ROUNDS_EXHAUSTED") {
      return "已达三轮审查上限（A20）：本次扩图被拒绝，运行已挂起等待用户显式处理，不会自动继续。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 409 && code === "RUN_HELD_FOR_USER") {
      return "运行正等待用户处理（A20）：先处理挂起事项，再考虑新的扩图请求。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 400 && code === "GRAPH_BUDGET_EXCEEDED") {
      return "预算不足（400）：图预算（64 节点 / 依赖深度 16）不允许本次扩图。详情: " + message;
    }
    return "失败" + (status ? "（HTTP " + String(status) + (code === "" ? "" : " " + code) + "）" : "") + ": " + message;
  }

  function roleOptionsHtml(selected) {
    var options = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < ROLE_OPTIONS.length; i++) {
      var isSelected = ROLE_OPTIONS[i] === selected ? ' selected' : '';
      options.push('<option value="' + esc(ROLE_OPTIONS[i]) + '"' + isSelected + '>' + esc(ROLE_OPTIONS[i]) + '</option>');
    }
    return options.join('');
  }

  function renderProposalCard(trigger, graphRevision, maxReviewRounds) {
    var t = trigger || {};
    var parts = [];
    parts.push('<div class="expansion-proposal" data-review-node-id="' + esc(t.reviewNodeId) + '" data-candidate-sha="' + esc(t.candidateSha) + '">');
    parts.push('<h3>扩图 Proposal：审查节点 ' + esc(t.reviewNodeId) + ' 在 candidate ' + esc(t.candidateSha) + ' 判为 fail</h3>');
    var mintedText = t.proposedFixNodeId === null || t.proposedFixNodeId === undefined
      ? '（需先显式选择修复目标）'
      : '修复节点 ' + esc(t.proposedFixNodeId) +
        (t.proposedFixRole ? '（角色 ' + esc(t.proposedFixRole) + '）' : '') +
        ' 与复审节点 ' + esc(t.proposedReviewNodeId) + '（reviewer）';
    parts.push('<p class="proposal-meta">第 ' + esc(t.triggerGeneration) + ' 轮审查失败；接受后将新增第 ' +
      esc(t.nextGeneration) + ' 轮：' + mintedText + '</p>');
    if (t.roundsExhausted === true) {
      parts.push('<p class="proposal-rounds">已达到每链 ' + esc(maxReviewRounds) +
        ' 轮审查上限（A20）：提交后运行将挂起，等待用户显式处理。</p>');
    }
    var findings = t.findings || [];
    if (findings.length > 0) {
      parts.push('<p class="proposal-why">为什么 fail（审查 findings）：</p>');
      parts.push('<ul class="findings">');
      for (var i = 0; i < findings.length; i++) parts.push('<li>' + esc(findings[i]) + '</li>');
      parts.push('</ul>');
    }
    parts.push('<form class="expansion-form" data-review-node-id="' + esc(t.reviewNodeId) +
      '" data-candidate-sha="' + esc(t.candidateSha) +
      '" data-expected-graph-revision="' + esc(graphRevision) + '">');
    parts.push('<label>发起角色（谁请求；A04 校验其子任务权限） <select name="requesterRoleId">' +
      roleOptionsHtml("coordinator") + '</select></label>');
    var deps = t.directDependencies || [];
    if (t.repairTargetAmbiguous === true) {
      if (deps.length > 1) {
        parts.push('<label>修复目标（该审查有多个依赖，需显式选择） <select name="repairedNodeId">');
        for (var k = 0; k < deps.length; k++) {
          parts.push('<option value="' + esc(deps[k]) + '">' + esc(deps[k]) + '</option>');
        }
        parts.push('</select></label>');
      } else {
        parts.push('<p class="proposal-rounds">该审查节点没有直接依赖，无法确定修复目标。</p>');
      }
    } else if (t.repairedNodeId) {
      parts.push('<input type="hidden" name="repairedNodeId" value="' + esc(t.repairedNodeId) + '">');
    }
    parts.push('<button type="submit">提交扩图请求</button><span class="expansion-status" role="status"></span>');
    parts.push('</form></div>');
    return parts.join('');
  }

  function renderExpansionCard(record) {
    var e = record || {};
    var fix = e.fixNode || {};
    var review = e.reviewNode || {};
    return '<div class="expansion-record">' +
      '<h3>已执行扩图 ' + esc(e.expansionId) + '</h3>' +
      '<p class="proposal-meta">请求人：' + (e.requestedBy ? esc(e.requestedBy) : '（未记录）') +
      ' · 触发：审查节点 ' + esc(e.triggerReviewNodeId) + ' 在 candidate ' + esc(e.triggerCandidateSha) +
      ' fail（第 ' + esc(e.triggerGeneration) + ' 轮）</p>' +
      '<p class="proposal-meta">新增节点：' + esc(fix.nodeId) + '（' + esc(fix.role) + '，' + esc(fix.state) + '） → ' +
      esc(review.nodeId) + '（' + esc(review.role) + '，' + esc(review.state) + '）</p>' +
      '</div>';
  }

  /* The whole expansion panel: budget headroom first, then the A20 hold
   * banner, then pending proposals, then executed expansions. */
  function renderExpansionPanel(container, view) {
    container.hidden = false;
    var v = view || {};
    var parts = [];
    var budget = v.budget || {};
    parts.push('<p class="expansion-budget">预算余量：节点 ' + esc(budget.nodeCount) + '/' + esc(budget.maxNodes) +
      '（余 ' + esc(budget.headroomNodes) + '） · 深度 ' + esc(budget.nodeDepth) + '/' + esc(budget.maxDepth) +
      '（余 ' + esc(budget.headroomDepth) + '） · 每链审查上限 ' + esc(v.maxReviewRounds) + ' 轮（含首次，A20）</p>');
    if (v.unresolvedHold) {
      var hold = v.unresolvedHold;
      parts.push('<div class="hold-banner" role="alert">已达到三轮审查上限（A20）：审查节点 ' + esc(hold.reviewNodeId) +
        ' 在 candidate ' + esc(hold.candidateSha) + ' 的第 ' + esc(hold.attemptedGeneration) +
        ' 轮扩图请求被拒绝。整个运行已挂起，等待用户显式处理；在此期间不会自动继续。</div>');
    }
    var triggers = v.pendingTriggers || [];
    var expansions = v.expansions || [];
    if (triggers.length === 0 && expansions.length === 0 && !v.unresolvedHold) {
      parts.push('<p class="hint">该运行当前没有待处理的扩图 Proposal，也没有已执行的扩图。</p>');
    }
    for (var i = 0; i < triggers.length; i++) {
      parts.push(renderProposalCard(triggers[i], v.graphRevision, v.maxReviewRounds));
    }
    for (var j = 0; j < expansions.length; j++) {
      parts.push(renderExpansionCard(expansions[j]));
    }
    container.innerHTML = parts.join('');
  }

  /* POST with the session token AND the session-bound CSRF token (fetched
   * once per page from GET /api/v1/session — the page never derives or
   * stores it beyond memory). Non-2xx envelopes become Error objects that
   * carry the server's code and HTTP status for the 409 flow. */
  var dagState = { runId: null, graph: null, csrfToken: null };
  var expansionState = { runId: null, view: null };
  var approvalState = { runId: null, view: null };
  var diffState = { runId: null, view: null };
  var contextState = { runId: null, view: null };

  /* ---- M5-03: approvals (A17), candidate diff (A12), context inventory ----
   * Same sanitization contract as every panel above: EVERY dynamic value
   * reaches the DOM through esc(...). The approval card shows the COMPLETE
   * digest constituents BEFORE any decision; a decision form addresses
   * exactly ONE actionDigest (its data-approval-id/-digest). FORBIDDEN_UI_
   * PHRASES names the global-grant vocabulary that must appear nowhere on
   * this page (A17: 审批不诱导全局放权) — the tests pin it. */

  /* Global-grant phrases that must NEVER appear anywhere in the served page
   * (structural test pin). The UI's only approval affordances are per-
   * actionDigest approve/reject buttons. */
  var FORBIDDEN_UI_PHRASES = ["全部允许", "信任此站点", "全部授权", "一键放行"];

  /* Display value mirroring the API's file-list cap (diff-view.ts). */
  var MAX_DIFF_FILES = 400;

  var DECISION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST = ["decision", "decidedBy", "reason"];

  /* UI-layer gate for decisions: the body is built from an EXPLICIT
   * allowlist; reject requires a reason (the server enforces it again). */
  function buildApprovalDecisionPayload(approvalId, fields) {
    var keys = Object.keys(fields || {});
    for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
      if (DECISION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST.indexOf(keys[i]) === -1) {
        throw new Error('refused field "' + keys[i] + '": decisions accept only decision/decidedBy/reason; model/Profile overrides are forbidden (A02)');
      }
    }
    var decision = fields && typeof fields.decision === "string" ? fields.decision : "";
    if (decision !== "approve" && decision !== "reject") {
      throw new Error('decision must be "approve" or "reject"');
    }
    var decidedBy = fields && typeof fields.decidedBy === "string" ? fields.decidedBy.trim() : "";
    if (decidedBy === "") {
      throw new Error("decidedBy is required: the decision is recorded on the approval row");
    }
    var payload = { decision: decision, decidedBy: decidedBy };
    if (decision === "reject") {
      var reason = typeof fields.reason === "string" ? fields.reason.trim() : "";
      if (reason === "") {
        throw new Error("拒绝必须填写原因（将记录在审批行上）");
      }
      payload.reason = reason;
    }
    return payload;
  }

  function invalidationTexts(codes) {
    var texts = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < codes.length; i++) {
      var code = String(codes[i]);
      if (code === "CANDIDATE_CHANGED") texts.push("候选 SHA 已变化（A17：原审批已无法消费）");
      else if (code === "EXPIRED") texts.push("已过期（过期审批不可批准）");
      else if (code === "STATUS_APPROVED") texts.push("已批准（等待检查点续行消费）");
      else if (code === "STATUS_CONSUMED") texts.push("已消费");
      else if (code === "STATUS_REJECTED") texts.push("已拒绝");
      else if (code === "STATUS_EXPIRED") texts.push("已失效（过期）");
      else texts.push(code);
    }
    return texts;
  }

  function listOrNone(items) {
    if (!items || items.length === 0) return "（无）";
    return items.join(", ");
  }

  /* One approval card: EVERY digest constituent visible, then the decision
   * affordance (only for a live PENDING approval) or the explicit 已失效 /
   * decided state. */
  function renderApprovalCard(a) {
    var v = a || {};
    var action = v.action || {};
    var repo = action.repo || {};
    var parts = [];
    parts.push('<div class="approval-card" data-approval-id="' + esc(v.approvalId) + '" data-approval-digest="' + esc(v.actionDigest) + '">');
    var invalidated = v.invalidations || [];
    var statusText = invalidated.length > 0
      ? '<span class="invalidated-badge">已失效</span>'
      : '<span class="approval-status approval-status-' + esc(v.status) + '">' + esc(v.status) + '</span>';
    parts.push('<h3>审批 ' + esc(v.approvalId) + ' ' + statusText + '</h3>');
    parts.push('<p class="approval-digest">actionDigest: <code>' + esc(v.actionDigest) + '</code></p>');
    parts.push('<table class="approval-detail"><tbody>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>命令 argv（完整、有序）</th><td><pre class="argv-view">');
    var argv = action.argv || [];
    for (var i = 0; i < argv.length; i++) parts.push(esc(argv[i]) + '\\n');
    parts.push('</pre></td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>运行时</th><td>' + esc(action.runtime) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>目标 SHA（targetSha）</th><td>' + esc(repo.targetSha === null || repo.targetSha === undefined ? "（无）" : repo.targetSha) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>基线（baseSha）</th><td>' + esc(repo.baseSha) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>仓库根</th><td>' + esc(repo.root) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>工作目录（cwd）</th><td>' + esc(action.cwd) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>冻结 Profile revision</th><td>' + esc(action.profileRevision) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>权限增量（批准将新增）</th><td>' + esc(listOrNone(v.permissionIncrements)) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>所需权限</th><td>' + esc(listOrNone(action.requiredPermissions)) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>已持有权限</th><td>' + esc(listOrNone(action.grantedPermissions)) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>效果维度</th><td>' + esc(listOrNone(action.dimensions)) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>写范围</th><td>' + esc(action.writeScope === null || action.writeScope === undefined ? "（无）" : action.writeScope) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>所需能力</th><td>' + esc(listOrNone(action.requiredCapabilities)) + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>风险等级</th><td>' + esc(v.riskGrade) + (v.requiresApproval ? '（高风险：需用户批准）' : '') + '</td></tr>');
    parts.push('<tr><th>过期时间</th><td>' + esc(v.expiresAt) + '</td></tr>');
    var req = v.requestedBy;
    parts.push('<tr><th>请求来源</th><td>' + (req ? esc(req.runId + " / " + req.nodeId + " / attempt " + String(req.attempt)) : "（未记录）") + '</td></tr>');
    if (v.currentCandidateSha !== null && v.currentCandidateSha !== undefined) {
      parts.push('<tr><th>该节点当前候选 SHA</th><td>' + esc(v.currentCandidateSha) + '</td></tr>');
    }
    parts.push('</tbody></table>');
    var reasons = v.riskReasons || [];
    if (reasons.length > 0) {
      parts.push('<p class="approval-why">风险原因：</p><ul class="risk-reasons">');
      for (var r = 0; r < reasons.length; r++) {
        parts.push('<li><code>' + esc(reasons[r].code) + '</code> ' + esc(reasons[r].detail) + '</li>');
      }
      parts.push('</ul>');
    }
    if (invalidated.length > 0) {
      var texts = invalidationTexts(invalidated);
      parts.push('<div class="invalidation-note" role="alert">该审批' + esc(texts.join("；")) +
        '。批准只会绑定上面这个 actionDigest，且已无法被消费 —— 请勿寻找绕过方式；如需继续，请让节点发起新的审批。</div>');
    } else {
      parts.push('<form class="approval-decision-form" data-approval-id="' + esc(v.approvalId) +
        '" data-approval-digest="' + esc(v.actionDigest) + '">');
      parts.push('<label>决策人 <input name="decidedBy" type="text" maxlength="128" spellcheck="false"></label>');
      parts.push('<label>拒绝原因（拒绝必填） <input name="reason" type="text" maxlength="2000" spellcheck="false"></label>');
      parts.push('<button type="submit" name="decision" value="approve">批准此动作（仅绑定该 actionDigest）</button>');
      parts.push('<button type="submit" name="decision" value="reject">拒绝此动作</button>');
      parts.push('<span class="decision-status" role="status"></span>');
      parts.push('</form>');
    }
    parts.push('</div>');
    return parts.join('');
  }

  function renderApprovalPanel(container, view) {
    container.hidden = false;
    var v = view || {};
    var approvals = v.approvals || [];
    if (approvals.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p class="hint">该运行当前没有审批记录。</p>';
      return;
    }
    var parts = ['<p class="approval-count">共 ' + esc(approvals.length) + ' 条审批（按创建顺序）。每条审批只绑定它自己的 actionDigest。</p>'];
    for (var i = 0; i < approvals.length; i++) parts.push(renderApprovalCard(approvals[i]));
    container.innerHTML = parts.join('');
  }

  /* Explicit refusal text per typed decision code. The A17 409 says 已失效
   * and never retries silently. */
  function approvalDecisionFailureText(error) {
    var code = error && error.code ? String(error.code) : "";
    var status = error && error.status ? Number(error.status) : 0;
    var message = error && error.message ? String(error.message) : "未知错误";
    if (status === 409 && code === "APPROVAL_INVALIDATED") {
      return "该审批已失效（候选 SHA 已变化或已被决定，A17）：不能批准，也不会被重复消费。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 409 && code === "APPROVAL_EXPIRED") {
      return "该审批已过期（过期审批不可消费）：不能批准。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 404) {
      return "未找到该审批（404）。详情: " + message;
    }
    if (status === 403) {
      return "拒绝（403）：不得通过审批提交 model/Profile 覆盖（A02）。详情: " + message;
    }
    return "失败" + (status ? "（HTTP " + String(status) + (code === "" ? "" : " " + code) + "）" : "") + ": " + message;
  }

  function verdictText(verdict) {
    if (verdict === "pass") return "通过（pass）";
    if (verdict === "fail") return "未通过（fail）";
    if (verdict === "blocked") return "阻塞（blocked）";
    return String(verdict);
  }

  /* The diff panel: candidate identity, the A12 verdict binding (a changed
   * candidate shows 已失效 — NEVER an old pass), the file list and the
   * unified diff as inert escaped text. */
  function renderDiffPanel(container, view) {
    container.hidden = false;
    var v = view || {};
    var parts = [];
    parts.push('<div class="diff-card" data-node-id="' + esc(v.nodeId) + '">');
    parts.push('<h3>候选 diff：节点 ' + esc(v.nodeId) + '</h3>');
    var integ = v.integration;
    if (integ) {
      var parents = integ.parents || [];
      var parentTexts = [];
      for (var p = 0; p < parents.length; p++) parentTexts.push(esc(parents[p].nodeId + "@" + parents[p].headSha));
      parts.push('<p class="diff-meta">集成分支 ' + esc(integ.integrationBranch) + ' · 状态 ' + esc(integ.state) +
        ' · 基线 ' + esc(integ.baseSha) + ' · 父输出 ' + (parentTexts.length > 0 ? parentTexts.join(", ") : "（无）") + '</p>');
      if (integ.conflictFiles !== null && integ.conflictFiles !== undefined) {
        parts.push('<p class="diff-conflict">集成冲突（PAUSED_CONFLICT）：' + esc(integ.conflictFiles.join(", ")) + '</p>');
      }
    }
    var review = v.review;
    if (v.candidateSha === null || v.candidateSha === undefined) {
      parts.push('<p class="hint">尚未产生候选提交（集成未完成或无集成记录），没有可展示的 diff，也没有可绑定审查的候选。</p>');
    } else {
      parts.push('<p class="diff-meta">候选 candidateSha: <code>' + esc(v.candidateSha) + '</code></p>');
      if (review && review.kind === "valid") {
        var evidence = review.evidenceRefs || [];
        parts.push('<div class="review-binding review-valid">审查绑定：' + esc(verdictText(review.verdict)) +
          '（reviewId ' + esc(review.reviewId) + '，完成于 ' + esc(review.completedAt) +
          '；证据 ' + (evidence.length > 0 ? esc(evidence.join(", ")) : "（无）") + '）—— 该结论只对上面这个 candidateSha 有效。</div>');
      } else if (review && review.kind === "invalidated") {
        var recorded = review.recordedCandidateShas || [];
        parts.push('<div class="review-binding review-invalidated"><span class="invalidated-badge">已失效</span> ' +
          'candidateSha 已变化：旧审查结果不适用于当前候选（A12）。曾记录的 candidate: ' +
          (recorded.length > 0 ? esc(recorded.join(", ")) : "（无）") + '。不会显示旧 pass。</div>');
      } else {
        parts.push('<div class="review-binding">该候选没有审查记录（尚未审查）。</div>');
      }
      var diff = v.diff;
      if (diff === null || diff === undefined) {
        parts.push('<p class="hint">diff 数据不可用。</p>');
      } else {
        var files = diff.files || [];
        if (diff.fileListTruncated === true) {
          parts.push('<p class="diff-truncated">文件列表已截断（超过 ' + esc(MAX_DIFF_FILES) + ' 个文件）。</p>');
        }
        parts.push('<table class="diff-files"><thead><tr><th>文件</th><th>状态</th><th>+/-</th></tr></thead><tbody>');
        for (var f = 0; f < files.length; f++) {
          var file = files[f];
          parts.push('<tr><td>' + esc(file.path) + '</td><td>' + esc(file.status) + '</td><td>' +
            (file.binary ? '（二进制）' : esc(String(file.additions === null ? "-" : file.additions) + " / " + String(file.deletions === null ? "-" : file.deletions))) +
            '</td></tr>');
        }
        parts.push('</tbody></table>');
        if (diff.unifiedTruncated === true) {
          parts.push('<p class="diff-truncated">统一 diff 内容过长，已截断展示（共 ' + esc(diff.unifiedChars) + ' 字符）。</p>');
        }
        parts.push('<pre class="diff-view">' + esc(diff.unified) + '</pre>');
      }
    }
    parts.push('</div>');
    container.innerHTML = parts.join('');
  }

  /* The context panel: per bundle, the fragment inventory with layer/
   * trust/truncation markers plus the trace record. Fragment CONTENT is not
   * served by the view (contentHash pins it); trust is shown because memory
   * content is DATA (untrusted-content), never policy (A16). */
  function renderContextPanel(container, view) {
    container.hidden = false;
    var v = view || {};
    var bundles = v.bundles || [];
    if (bundles.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p class="hint">该运行当前没有已持久化的 context bundle。</p>';
      return;
    }
    var parts = [];
    for (var b = 0; b < bundles.length; b++) {
      var bundle = bundles[b];
      parts.push('<div class="context-bundle" data-bundle-id="' + esc(bundle.bundleId) + '">');
      parts.push('<h3>bundle：节点 ' + esc(bundle.nodeId) + '（角色 ' + esc(bundle.roleId) + '）</h3>');
      parts.push('<p class="context-meta">预算 ' + esc(bundle.budgetMethod) + ' ≤ ' +
        esc(bundle.budgetBytes === null || bundle.budgetBytes === undefined ? "（无上限）" : bundle.budgetBytes) +
        (bundle.budgetExceeded ? ' · <span class="context-over">预算仍被超出（安全优先，已记录）</span>' : '') +
        ' · 片段 ' + esc(bundle.includedCount) + '/' + esc(bundle.fragmentCount) + ' 入选 · ' + esc(bundle.byteCount) + ' 字节</p>');
      parts.push('<p class="context-meta">contentHash <code>' + esc(bundle.contentHash) + '</code> · manifestHash <code>' + esc(bundle.manifestHash) + '</code></p>');
      var fragments = bundle.fragments || [];
      parts.push('<table class="context-table"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>层级</th><th>trust</th><th>来源</th><th>版本 / SHA</th><th>字节</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>');
      for (var i = 0; i < fragments.length; i++) {
        var frag = fragments[i];
        var src = frag.source || {};
        var versionBits = [];
        if (src.revision !== null && src.revision !== undefined) versionBits.push('rev ' + src.revision);
        if (src.profileId !== null && src.profileId !== undefined) versionBits.push('profile ' + src.profileId);
        if (src.commitSha !== null && src.commitSha !== undefined) versionBits.push('commit ' + src.commitSha);
        if (src.artifactId !== null && src.artifactId !== undefined) versionBits.push('artifact ' + src.artifactId);
        parts.push('<tr><td>' + esc(frag.sequence) + '</td><td>' + esc(frag.layer) + '</td>' +
          '<td><span class="trust trust-' + esc(frag.trust) + '">' + esc(frag.trust) + '</span></td>' +
          '<td>' + esc(src.kind) + '<br><code>' + esc(src.id) + '</code></td>' +
          '<td>' + (versionBits.length > 0 ? esc(versionBits.join(" · ")) : "（无）") + '</td>' +
          '<td>' + esc(frag.contentBytes) + '</td>' +
          '<td>' + (frag.included
            ? '入选（层级优先级 ' + esc(frag.layerPriority) + '）'
            : '<span class="truncated-marker">已截断</span>' + (frag.omittedReason ? '（' + esc(frag.omittedReason) + '）' : '')) +
          '</td></tr>');
      }
      parts.push('</tbody></table>');
      parts.push('<p class="hint">截断顺序：memory 检索命中最先被丢，project_rule 永不截断；被截断片段的内容 hash 已记录在 omitted 清单中。</p>');
      parts.push('</div>');
    }
    container.innerHTML = parts.join('');
  }

  function loadRunApprovals(runId, token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/approvals", token).then(function (body) {
      approvalState.runId = runId;
      approvalState.view = body.approval;
      var panel = document.getElementById("approval-panel");
      if (panel !== null) renderApprovalPanel(panel, body.approval);
      return body.approval;
    });
  }

  function loadRunDiff(runId, nodeId, token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/diff?nodeId=" + encodeURIComponent(nodeId), token)
      .then(function (body) {
        diffState.runId = runId;
        diffState.view = body.diff;
        var panel = document.getElementById("diff-panel");
        if (panel !== null) renderDiffPanel(panel, body.diff);
        return body.diff;
      });
  }

  function loadRunContexts(runId, token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/contexts", token).then(function (body) {
      contextState.runId = runId;
      contextState.view = body.context;
      var panel = document.getElementById("context-panel");
      if (panel !== null) renderContextPanel(panel, body.context);
      return body.context;
    });
  }


  /* POST/PUT with the session token AND the session-bound CSRF token (fetched
   * once per page from GET /api/v1/session — the page never derives or
   * stores it beyond memory). Non-2xx envelopes become Error objects that
   * carry the server's code and HTTP status for the 409/422 flows. */
  function requestJson(method, path, token, csrfToken, payload) {
    return fetch(path, {
      method: method,
      headers: {
        "Authorization": "Bearer " + token,
        "x-csrf-token": csrfToken,
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      },
      body: JSON.stringify(payload)
    }).then(function (response) {
      return response.json().catch(function () { return {}; }).then(function (body) {
        if (!response.ok) {
          var reason = body && body.error && body.error.message ? body.error.message : ("HTTP " + response.status);
          var error = new Error(reason);
          error.code = body && body.error ? body.error.code : undefined;
          error.status = response.status;
          /* Structured rejection context (e.g. currentGraphRevision on a
           * 409, A38) rides beside the error envelope. */
          if (body && typeof body === "object") {
            for (var key in body) {
              if (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(body, key) && key !== "error") {
                error[key] = body[key];
              }
            }
          }
          throw error;
        }
        return body;
      });
    });
  }

  function postJson(path, token, csrfToken, payload) {
    return requestJson("POST", path, token, csrfToken, payload);
  }

  /* M9-03: the profiles config write-back (PUT /api/v1/profiles/full). */
  function putJson(path, token, csrfToken, payload) {
    return requestJson("PUT", path, token, csrfToken, payload);
  }

  function loadRunGraph(runId, token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/graph", token).then(function (body) {
      dagState.runId = runId;
      dagState.graph = body.graph;
      renderRunGraph(document.getElementById("graph-canvas"), body.graph);
      renderNodeEditor(document.getElementById("node-editor"), { node: null });
      return body.graph;
    });
  }

  function loadExpansionState(runId, token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/expansions", token).then(function (body) {
      expansionState.runId = runId;
      expansionState.view = body.expansion;
      var panel = document.getElementById("expansion-panel");
      if (panel !== null) renderExpansionPanel(panel, body.expansion);
      return body.expansion;
    });
  }

  function wireDom() {
    var button = document.getElementById("load-button");
    var tokenInput = document.getElementById("token-input");
    var executionInput = document.getElementById("execution-input");
    if (button === null || tokenInput === null || executionInput === null) return;
    button.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value; /* kept in memory only; never persisted, never in URLs */
      var executionId = executionInput.value.trim();
      if (token === "" || executionId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌与执行 ID"); return; }
      setStatus("加载中…");
      fetchJson("/api/v1/executions/" + encodeURIComponent(executionId), token)
        .then(function (body) {
          /* The route answers {schemaVersion, execution: {...}} — unwrap it
           * before rendering (M5-05 browser e2e found the raw body reaching
           * the template, which rendered every field as undefined). */
          var status = body && typeof body === "object" && body.execution !== undefined
            ? body.execution
            : body;
          renderRunDetail(document.getElementById("run-detail"), {
            taskId: executionId, id: status.runId, status: status.phase, baseSha: "-",
            executions: [status]
          });
          return fetchJson("/api/v1/executions/" + encodeURIComponent(executionId) + "/events?limit=200", token);
        })
        .then(function (page) { renderEvents(document.getElementById("events"), page.events); setStatus("完成"); })
        .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
    });
    var workbenchTab = document.getElementById("tab-workbench");
    var configTab = document.getElementById("tab-config");
    var advancedTab = document.getElementById("tab-advanced");
    if (workbenchTab !== null) workbenchTab.addEventListener("click", function () { showPageTab("workbench"); });
    if (configTab !== null) configTab.addEventListener("click", function () { showPageTab("config"); });
    if (advancedTab !== null) advancedTab.addEventListener("click", function () { showPageTab("advanced"); });
    wireDagDom(tokenInput);
    wireWorkbenchDom(tokenInput);
    wireConfigDom(tokenInput);
  }

  function wireDagDom(tokenInput) {
    var runInput = document.getElementById("run-graph-input");
    var loadButton = document.getElementById("load-graph-button");
    var canvas = document.getElementById("graph-canvas");
    var editor = document.getElementById("node-editor");
    if (runInput === null || loadButton === null || canvas === null || editor === null) return;

    loadButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      var runId = runInput.value.trim();
      if (token === "" || runId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌与运行 ID"); return; }
      setStatus("加载任务图…");
      loadRunGraph(runId, token)
        .then(function (graph) { setStatus("已加载任务图 revision " + graph.graphRevision); })
        .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
    });

    /* Event delegation (CSP: no inline handlers): a click anywhere inside a
     * node group opens that node's editor. */
    canvas.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      while (target !== null && target !== canvas && !(target.classList && target.classList.contains("dag-node"))) {
        target = target.parentNode;
      }
      if (target === null || target === canvas || dagState.graph === null) return;
      var nodeId = target.getAttribute("data-node-id");
      var nodes = dagState.graph.nodes || [];
      for (var i = 0; i < nodes.length; i++) {
        if (nodes[i].nodeId === nodeId) {
          renderNodeEditor(editor, { node: nodes[i], graphRevision: dagState.graph.graphRevision, runId: dagState.runId });
          return;
        }
      }
    });

    editor.addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
      var form = event.target;
      if (form === null || form.id !== "node-edit-form") return;
      event.preventDefault(); /* never a navigation: the edit goes through fetch */
      var status = form.querySelector(".editor-status");
      var show = function (text) { if (status !== null) status.textContent = text; };
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      var payload;
      try {
        payload = buildNodeEditPayload(
          form.getAttribute("data-node-id"),
          Number(form.getAttribute("data-graph-revision")),
          {
            role: form.elements.role.value,
            objective: form.elements.objective.value,
            dependencies: form.elements.dependencies.value
          }
        );
      } catch (error) {
        show("拒绝: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
        return;
      }
      if (token === "") { show("请先输入会话令牌"); return; }
      show("提交中…");
      var ensureCsrf = dagState.csrfToken !== null
        ? Promise.resolve(dagState.csrfToken)
        : fetchJson("/api/v1/session", token).then(function (body) {
            dagState.csrfToken = body.csrfToken;
            return body.csrfToken;
          });
      ensureCsrf
        .then(function (csrf) {
          return postJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(dagState.runId) + "/graph/edits", token, csrf, payload);
        })
        .then(function (body) {
          show("已保存，新 revision " + body.revision);
          return loadRunGraph(dagState.runId, token);
        })
        .then(function (graph) { setStatus("任务图已刷新 revision " + graph.graphRevision); })
        .catch(function (error) {
          if (error && error.status === 409) {
            show("冲突: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error) + " —— 请重新加载任务图");
          } else {
            show("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
          }
        });
    });

    /* ---- M5-02: the expansion panel wiring (event delegation again: the
     * panel's cards and forms are re-rendered on every load, so the submit
     * handler lives on the panel, never inline on a form). ---- */
    var expansionButton = document.getElementById("load-expansions-button");
    var expansionPanel = document.getElementById("expansion-panel");
    if (expansionButton !== null && expansionPanel !== null) {
      expansionButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
        var token = tokenInput.value;
        var runId = runInput.value.trim();
        if (token === "" || runId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌与运行 ID"); return; }
        setStatus("加载扩图状态…");
        loadExpansionState(runId, token)
          .then(function (view) {
            setStatus("已加载扩图状态 revision " + view.graphRevision);
          })
          .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
      });

      expansionPanel.addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
        var form = event.target;
        if (form === null || typeof form.classList !== "object" || !form.classList.contains("expansion-form")) return;
        event.preventDefault(); /* never a navigation: the request goes through fetch */
        var status = form.querySelector(".expansion-status");
        var show = function (text) { if (status !== null) status.textContent = text; };
        var token = tokenInput.value;
        if (token === "") { show("请先输入会话令牌"); return; }
        var fields = { requesterRoleId: form.elements.requesterRoleId.value };
        if (form.elements.repairedNodeId !== undefined && form.elements.repairedNodeId !== null) {
          fields.repairedNodeId = form.elements.repairedNodeId.value;
        }
        var payload;
        try {
          payload = buildExpansionRequestPayload(
            form.getAttribute("data-review-node-id"),
            form.getAttribute("data-candidate-sha"),
            Number(form.getAttribute("data-expected-graph-revision")),
            fields
          );
        } catch (error) {
          show("拒绝: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
          return;
        }
        var runId = expansionState.runId;
        if (runId === null || runId === undefined) { show("请先加载扩图状态"); return; }
        show("提交中…");
        var ensureCsrf = dagState.csrfToken !== null
          ? Promise.resolve(dagState.csrfToken)
          : fetchJson("/api/v1/session", token).then(function (body) {
              dagState.csrfToken = body.csrfToken;
              return body.csrfToken;
            });
        ensureCsrf
          .then(function (csrf) {
            return postJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId) + "/expansions", token, csrf, payload);
          })
          .then(function (body) {
            show(body.created === false
              ? "该 fail 已扩图过（幂等重放），未新增节点。"
              : "扩图完成：新增 " + body.fixNode.nodeId + " 与 " + body.reviewNode.nodeId + "，新 revision " + body.revision);
            return loadRunGraph(runId, token);
          })
          .then(function (graph) {
            setStatus("任务图已刷新 revision " + graph.graphRevision);
            return loadExpansionState(runId, token);
          })
          .then(function (view) { setStatus("任务图与扩图状态已刷新 revision " + view.graphRevision); })
          .catch(function (error) { show(expansionRequestFailureText(error)); });
      });
    }

    /* ---- M5-03: approvals / diff / contexts wiring (same event-delegation
     * pattern: panels re-render on every load, so submit handlers live on
     * the panel, never inline on a form). ---- */
    wireApprovalsDom(tokenInput, runInput);
    wireDiffDom(tokenInput, runInput);
    wireContextsDom(tokenInput, runInput);
  }

  function ensureCsrfToken(token) {
    return dagState.csrfToken !== null
      ? Promise.resolve(dagState.csrfToken)
      : fetchJson("/api/v1/session", token).then(function (body) {
          dagState.csrfToken = body.csrfToken;
          return body.csrfToken;
        });
  }

  function wireApprovalsDom(tokenInput, runInput) {
    var loadButton = document.getElementById("load-approvals-button");
    var panel = document.getElementById("approval-panel");
    if (loadButton === null || panel === null) return;
    loadButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      var runId = runInput.value.trim();
      if (token === "" || runId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌与运行 ID"); return; }
      setStatus("加载审批…");
      loadRunApprovals(runId, token)
        .then(function (view) { setStatus("已加载审批 " + view.approvals.length + " 条"); })
        .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
    });

    panel.addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
      var form = event.target;
      if (form === null || typeof form.classList !== "object" || !form.classList.contains("approval-decision-form")) return;
      event.preventDefault(); /* never a navigation: the decision goes through fetch */
      var status = form.querySelector(".decision-status");
      var show = function (text) { if (status !== null) status.textContent = text; };
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      if (token === "") { show("请先输入会话令牌"); return; }
      var approvalId = form.getAttribute("data-approval-id");
      var submitter = event.submitter || form.querySelector('button[name="decision"]');
      var decision = submitter && submitter.value === "reject" ? "reject" : "approve";
      var payload;
      try {
        payload = buildApprovalDecisionPayload(approvalId, {
          decision: decision,
          decidedBy: form.elements.decidedBy.value,
          reason: form.elements.reason.value
        });
      } catch (error) {
        show("拒绝: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
        return;
      }
      show("提交中…");
      ensureCsrfToken(token)
        .then(function (csrf) {
          return postJson("/api/v1/approvals/" + encodeURIComponent(approvalId) + "/decision", token, csrf, payload);
        })
        .then(function (body) {
          show(body.decision === "approve"
            ? "已批准（绑定该 actionDigest；等待检查点续行时消费）。"
            : "已拒绝（原因已记录）。");
          return loadRunApprovals(approvalState.runId, token);
        })
        .catch(function (error) { show(approvalDecisionFailureText(error)); });
    });
  }

  function wireDiffDom(tokenInput, runInput) {
    var loadButton = document.getElementById("load-diff-button");
    var nodeInput = document.getElementById("diff-node-input");
    var panel = document.getElementById("diff-panel");
    if (loadButton === null || nodeInput === null || panel === null) return;
    loadButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      var runId = runInput.value.trim();
      var nodeId = nodeInput.value.trim();
      if (token === "" || runId === "" || nodeId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌、运行 ID 与节点 ID"); return; }
      setStatus("加载候选 diff…");
      loadRunDiff(runId, nodeId, token)
        .then(function (view) {
          setStatus(view.candidateSha === null
            ? "该节点尚未产生候选提交"
            : "已加载候选 diff（candidate " + view.candidateSha + "）");
        })
        .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
    });
  }

  function wireContextsDom(tokenInput, runInput) {
    var loadButton = document.getElementById("load-contexts-button");
    var panel = document.getElementById("context-panel");
    if (loadButton === null || panel === null) return;
    loadButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      var runId = runInput.value.trim();
      if (token === "" || runId === "") { setStatus("请输入令牌与运行 ID"); return; }
      setStatus("加载上下文清单…");
      loadRunContexts(runId, token)
        .then(function (view) { setStatus("已加载上下文 bundle " + view.bundles.length + " 个"); })
        .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
    });
  }

  /* ---- M9-02: the task workbench (default tab) ----------------------------
   * Same sanitization contract as every panel above: EVERY dynamic value
   * reaches the DOM through esc(...). The create form builds its body from
   * an EXPLICIT allowlist (objective/profileId/projectDir — no model/Profile
   * field anywhere, the UI layer of A02); the backend strict schema stays
   * the boundary, front-end checks are experience-only. The run list
   * re-renders from GET /api/v1/runs on a 2s poll; an expanded run fetches
   * its detail on the same tick and subscribes ONE WebSocket per execution
   * to /api/v1/events/live (first-message auth, client-side eventId dedup
   * per A39), appending events live through the SAME eventToHtml esc path. */

  var RUN_CREATE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST = ["objective", "profileId", "projectDir"];
  var RUN_STATUS_GLOSS = {
    PLANNED: "排队中",
    RUNNING: "执行中",
    READY_FOR_DELIVERY: "待交付",
    DELIVERED: "已交付",
    CANCELLED: "已取消"
  };
  var workbenchState = {
    lastRuns: [],
    expandedRunId: null,
    seenEvents: {},
    sockets: {},
    pollTimer: null
  };

  /* UI-layer A02 gate for run creation: the body is built from an EXPLICIT
   * allowlist; any other field name is refused here and never becomes a
   * request field. The backend strict schema re-validates everything. */
  function buildRunCreatePayload(fields) {
    var keys = Object.keys(fields || {});
    for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
      if (RUN_CREATE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST.indexOf(keys[i]) === -1) {
        throw new Error('refused field "' + keys[i] + '": run creation accepts only objective/profileId/projectDir; model/Profile overrides are forbidden (A02)');
      }
    }
    var objective = fields && typeof fields.objective === "string" ? fields.objective : "";
    if (objective.length === 0 || objective.length > 10000 || objective.trim().length === 0) {
      throw new Error("objective 必填(1..10000 字符,不可全空白)");
    }
    var profileId = fields && typeof fields.profileId === "string" ? fields.profileId.trim() : "";
    if (profileId === "") throw new Error("请先载入并选择执行 profile");
    var projectDir = fields && typeof fields.projectDir === "string" ? fields.projectDir.trim() : "";
    if (projectDir === "") throw new Error("工作目录必填(绝对路径)");
    return { objective: objective, profileId: profileId, projectDir: projectDir };
  }

  /* 体验层提示(非安全边界): the page cannot stat the filesystem, so the
   * only client-checkable property is the absolute-path shape (drive letter,
   * POSIX root, or a \\server UNC prefix — charCode 92 avoids backslash
   * literals). Existence / directory / git-baseline validation is the
   * backend's fail-closed job; its typed 400 codes surface verbatim via
   * createRunFailureText. */
  function projectDirHint(value) {
    var text = String(value === undefined || value === null ? "" : value).trim();
    if (text === "") return "";
    var looksAbsolute =
      /^[A-Za-z]:[\\\\/]/.test(text) || text.charAt(0) === "/" || (text.charCodeAt(0) === 92 && text.charCodeAt(1) === 92);
    if (looksAbsolute) return "";
    return "提示:这不是绝对路径(Windows 盘符开头或 POSIX / 开头);后端会以 PROJECT_DIR_NOT_ABSOLUTE 拒绝。";
  }

  function profileOptionsHtml(profiles) {
    var list = profiles || [];
    var parts = ['<option value="">(选择执行 profile)</option>'];
    for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {
      var p = list[i] || {};
      var label = esc(p.id) + " · " + esc(p.runtime) + " · " + esc(p.executionTarget) +
        " · " + (p.model ? "model " + esc(p.model) : "默认模型") +
        " · 超时 " + esc(p.timeoutSeconds) + "s";
      parts.push('<option value="' + esc(p.id) + '">' + label + "</option>");
    }
    return parts.join("");
  }

  function runStatusBadgeHtml(status) {
    var s = String(status === undefined || status === null ? "" : status);
    var gloss = Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(RUN_STATUS_GLOSS, s) ? RUN_STATUS_GLOSS[s] : "";
    return '<span class="run-status-badge run-status-' + esc(s) + '">' + esc(s) + (gloss === "" ? "" : " · " + gloss) + "</span>";
  }

  function runRowHtml(run, expandedRunId) {
    var r = run || {};
    var expanded = r.id !== undefined && r.id === expandedRunId;
    return '<div class="run-row' + (expanded ? " run-row-expanded" : "") + '" data-run-id="' + esc(r.id) + '">' +
      '<button type="button" class="run-row-toggle" data-run-id="' + esc(r.id) + '">' +
      '<span class="run-objective">' + esc(r.objective === null || r.objective === undefined ? "(无 objective)" : r.objective) + "</span>" +
      runStatusBadgeHtml(r.status) +
      '<time class="run-created">' + esc(r.createdAt) + "</time>" +
      "</button></div>";
  }

  function renderRunList(container, runs, expandedRunId) {
    var list = runs || [];
    container.hidden = false;
    if (list.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML = '<p class="hint">还没有任务。输入令牌后用上方表单创建第一个任务。</p>';
      return;
    }
    var parts = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < list.length; i++) parts.push(runRowHtml(list[i], expandedRunId));
    container.innerHTML = parts.join("");
  }

  /* Honest failure note (M9-01 §7): the run-status vocabulary has no failed
   * value — a failed node keeps the run RUNNING, so the executions (and the
   * live events) carry the truth, and the UI says so explicitly. */
  function runFailureNoteHtml(run) {
    var executions = (run && run.executions) || [];
    var failed = 0;
    var active = 0;
    for (var i = 0; i < executions.length; i++) {
      var phase = String(executions[i].phase || "");
      if (phase === "FAILED") failed += 1;
      else if (phase === "RUNNING" || phase === "STARTING" || phase === "PREPARING") active += 1;
    }
    if (failed > 0) {
      return '<p class="run-failure-note" role="alert">注意:存在失败执行(共 ' + esc(failed) +
        " 个)。run 级状态无失败值——失败证据在执行 phase 与下方事件流;审批停靠时节点停 WAITING_APPROVAL,完整审批卡在「高级」页签。</p>";
    }
    if (active > 0) return '<p class="hint">执行进行中…事件经 WS 实时追加。</p>';
    return "";
  }

  /* The expanded run's detail card (status badge + failure note + the
   * EXISTING run-detail renderer's execution inventory). Pure builder. */
  function runDetailCardHtml(run) {
    var r = run || {};
    return '<div class="workbench-detail-head">' + runStatusBadgeHtml(r.status) +
      '<span class="run-detail-id">run ' + esc(r.id) + "</span>" +
      '<span class="run-detail-created">' + esc(r.createdAt) + "</span></div>" +
      runFailureNoteHtml(r) +
      runDetailHtml({ taskId: r.taskId, id: r.id, status: r.status, baseSha: r.baseSha, executions: r.executions || [] });
  }

  function createRunFailureText(error) {
    var code = error && error.code ? String(error.code) : "";
    var status = error && error.status ? Number(error.status) : 0;
    var message = error && error.message ? String(error.message) : "未知错误";
    if (status === 400 && code === "PROJECT_DIR_NOT_ABSOLUTE") return "创建失败(400):工作目录必须是绝对路径。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 400 && code === "PROJECT_DIR_MISSING") return "创建失败(400):工作目录不存在或不可访问(后端 fail-closed,未创建任何任务)。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 400 && code === "PROJECT_DIR_NOT_DIRECTORY") return "创建失败(400):该路径不是目录。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 400 && code === "PROJECT_DIR_NOT_GIT_REPOSITORY") return "创建失败(400):该目录不是 git 仓库(worktree 隔离需要真实基线)。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 400 && code === "UNKNOWN_PROFILE") return "创建失败(400):profile 不在本进程加载清单中,请重新载入 profiles。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 409) return "创建失败(409):profile 定义与已存在记录漂移(改定义是人的决定,不是 upsert)。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 503) return "创建失败(503):本服务进程未配置编排(serve --profiles),不能创建任务。详情: " + message;
    return "失败" + (status ? "(HTTP " + String(status) + (code === "" ? "" : " " + code) + ")" : "") + ": " + message;
  }

  /* The expanded detail area is a STABLE skeleton: only the card slot is
   * re-rendered by the poll; the events box persists so WS appends are
   * never clobbered mid-stream. */
  function workbenchDetailSkeleton() {
    return '<div class="workbench-detail-card"></div>' +
      '<h3 class="workbench-events-head">实时事件(WS /api/v1/events/live 直播)</h3>' +
      '<div class="workbench-events"><p class="hint">等待事件…(订阅后已落库事件会立即回放)</p></div>' +
      '<p class="hint">审批卡、任务图与候选 diff 等完整观测面在「高级」页签(运行 ID 可粘贴本行 run id)。</p>';
  }

  function closeAllLiveSockets() {
    for (var key in workbenchState.sockets) {
      try { workbenchState.sockets[key].close(); } catch (error) { /* already closed */ }
    }
    workbenchState.sockets = {};
  }

  function appendWorkbenchEvent(envelope) {
    var box = document.querySelector("#workbench-detail .workbench-events");
    if (box === null) return;
    var list = box.querySelector("ul.events");
    if (list === null) {
      box.innerHTML = '<ul class="events"></ul>';
      list = box.querySelector("ul.events");
      if (list === null) return;
    }
    list.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend", eventToHtml({
      seq: envelope.seq,
      type: envelope.type,
      occurredAt: envelope.occurredAt,
      payload: envelope.payload
    }));
  }

  /* ONE WebSocket per execution (server protocol: a connection carries
   * exactly one subscription). First-message auth, then subscribe; events
   * are deduped by eventId (A39 client duty). A dropped socket is reopened
   * by the next detail poll while the run stays expanded. */
  function subscribeLiveEvents(executionId, token) {
    if (workbenchState.sockets[executionId] !== undefined) return;
    var seen = workbenchState.seenEvents[executionId];
    if (!seen) {
      seen = {};
      workbenchState.seenEvents[executionId] = seen;
    }
    var socket;
    try {
      socket = new WebSocket("ws://" + window.location.host + "/api/v1/events/live");
    } catch (error) {
      return;
    }
    workbenchState.sockets[executionId] = socket;
    socket.onopen = function () {
      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: "auth", token: token }));
      socket.send(JSON.stringify({ type: "subscribe", executionId: executionId }));
    };
    socket.onmessage = function (message) {
      var frame;
      try { frame = JSON.parse(String(message.data)); } catch (error) { return; }
      if (frame && frame.type === "event" && frame.event) {
        if (seen[frame.event.eventId] === true) return;
        seen[frame.event.eventId] = true;
        appendWorkbenchEvent(frame.event);
      }
    };
    socket.onclose = function () {
      if (workbenchState.sockets[executionId] === socket) delete workbenchState.sockets[executionId];
    };
  }

  function refreshExpandedRun(token) {
    var runId = workbenchState.expandedRunId;
    if (runId === null) return Promise.resolve(null);
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs/" + encodeURIComponent(runId), token).then(function (body) {
      if (workbenchState.expandedRunId !== runId) return null; /* collapsed meanwhile */
      var detail = document.getElementById("workbench-detail");
      var card = detail !== null ? detail.querySelector(".workbench-detail-card") : null;
      if (card !== null) card.innerHTML = runDetailCardHtml(body.run);
      var executions = (body.run && body.run.executions) || [];
      for (var i = 0; i < executions.length; i++) subscribeLiveEvents(executions[i].id, token);
      return body.run;
    });
  }

  function refreshRunList(token) {
    return fetchJson("/api/v1/runs", token).then(function (body) {
      workbenchState.lastRuns = body.runs || [];
      var panel = document.getElementById("run-list-panel");
      if (panel !== null) renderRunList(panel, workbenchState.lastRuns, workbenchState.expandedRunId);
      return workbenchState.lastRuns;
    });
  }

  function expandRun(runId, token) {
    workbenchState.expandedRunId = runId;
    workbenchState.seenEvents = {};
    closeAllLiveSockets();
    var detail = document.getElementById("workbench-detail");
    if (detail !== null) {
      detail.hidden = false;
      detail.innerHTML = workbenchDetailSkeleton();
    }
    var panel = document.getElementById("run-list-panel");
    if (panel !== null) renderRunList(panel, workbenchState.lastRuns, runId);
    refreshExpandedRun(token).catch(function (error) {
      var card = detail !== null ? detail.querySelector(".workbench-detail-card") : null;
      if (card !== null) card.textContent = "加载详情失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error);
    });
  }

  function collapseRun() {
    workbenchState.expandedRunId = null;
    closeAllLiveSockets();
    var detail = document.getElementById("workbench-detail");
    if (detail !== null) {
      detail.hidden = true;
      detail.innerHTML = "";
    }
    var panel = document.getElementById("run-list-panel");
    if (panel !== null) renderRunList(panel, workbenchState.lastRuns, null);
  }

  /* M9-03: the three-tab switch (工作台 default / 配置 / 高级). Exactly one
   * page container visible, exactly one tab button active; the advanced
   * container keeps every observatory id (unchanged since M5). */
  function showPageTab(which) {
    var workbenchPage = document.getElementById("tab-workbench-page");
    var configPage = document.getElementById("tab-config-page");
    var advancedPage = document.getElementById("tab-advanced-page");
    var workbenchTab = document.getElementById("tab-workbench");
    var configTab = document.getElementById("tab-config");
    var advancedTab = document.getElementById("tab-advanced");
    var isWorkbench = which === "workbench";
    var isConfig = which === "config";
    if (workbenchPage !== null) workbenchPage.hidden = !isWorkbench;
    if (configPage !== null) configPage.hidden = !isConfig;
    if (advancedPage !== null) advancedPage.hidden = isWorkbench || isConfig;
    if (workbenchTab !== null) workbenchTab.classList.toggle("tab-active", isWorkbench);
    if (configTab !== null) configTab.classList.toggle("tab-active", isConfig);
    if (advancedTab !== null) advancedTab.classList.toggle("tab-active", !isWorkbench && !isConfig);
  }

  function wireWorkbenchDom(tokenInput) {
    var form = document.getElementById("create-run-form");
    var objectiveInput = document.getElementById("objective-input");
    var profileSelect = document.getElementById("profile-select");
    var loadProfilesButton = document.getElementById("load-profiles-button");
    var projectDirInput = document.getElementById("projectdir-input");
    var projectDirHintSpan = document.getElementById("projectdir-hint");
    var createStatus = document.getElementById("create-status");
    var refreshButton = document.getElementById("refresh-runs-button");
    var listPanel = document.getElementById("run-list-panel");
    if (form === null || listPanel === null || tokenInput === null) return;

    /* Experience-layer hint only; assigned via textContent (no HTML parsing). */
    if (projectDirInput !== null && projectDirHintSpan !== null) {
      projectDirInput.addEventListener("input", function () {
        projectDirHintSpan.textContent = projectDirHint(projectDirInput.value);
      });
    }

    function loadProfiles(token) {
      return fetchJson("/api/v1/profiles", token).then(function (body) {
        if (profileSelect !== null) profileSelect.innerHTML = profileOptionsHtml(body.profiles);
        return body.profiles;
      });
    }
    if (loadProfilesButton !== null) {
      loadProfilesButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
        var token = tokenInput.value;
        if (token === "") { setStatus("请先输入会话令牌,再载入 profiles"); return; }
        setStatus("载入 profiles…");
        loadProfiles(token)
          .then(function (profiles) { setStatus("已载入 " + profiles.length + " 个 profile"); })
          .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
      });
    }

    if (refreshButton !== null) {
      refreshButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
        var token = tokenInput.value;
        if (token === "") { setStatus("请先输入会话令牌,再刷新任务列表"); return; }
        setStatus("刷新任务列表…");
        refreshRunList(token)
          .then(function (runs) { setStatus("任务列表已刷新(共 " + runs.length + " 项)"); })
          .catch(function (error) { setStatus("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error)); });
      });
    }

    /* Event delegation: the list re-renders on every poll, so the click
     * handler lives on the panel, never on a row. */
    listPanel.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      while (target !== null && target !== listPanel && !(target.classList && target.classList.contains("run-row-toggle"))) {
        target = target.parentNode;
      }
      if (target === null || target === listPanel) return;
      var runId = target.getAttribute("data-run-id");
      if (runId === null || runId === "") return;
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      if (token === "") { setStatus("请先输入会话令牌,再展开任务"); return; }
      if (workbenchState.expandedRunId === runId) collapseRun();
      else expandRun(runId, token);
    });

    form.addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
      if (event.target === null || event.target.id !== "create-run-form") return;
      event.preventDefault(); /* never a navigation: the create goes through fetch */
      var show = function (text) { if (createStatus !== null) createStatus.textContent = text; };
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      if (token === "") { show("请先输入会话令牌"); return; }
      var payload;
      try {
        payload = buildRunCreatePayload({
          objective: objectiveInput !== null ? objectiveInput.value : "",
          profileId: profileSelect !== null ? profileSelect.value : "",
          projectDir: projectDirInput !== null ? projectDirInput.value : ""
        });
      } catch (error) {
        show("拒绝: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
        return;
      }
      show("提交中…");
      var ensureCsrf = dagState.csrfToken !== null
        ? Promise.resolve(dagState.csrfToken)
        : fetchJson("/api/v1/session", token).then(function (body) {
            dagState.csrfToken = body.csrfToken;
            return body.csrfToken;
          });
      ensureCsrf
        .then(function (csrf) { return postJson("/api/v1/runs", token, csrf, payload); })
        .then(function (body) {
          /* textContent target: no esc() here — textContent never parses HTML. */
          show("已接受(202 " + body.status + "):任务 " + body.runId + " 已入队,由服务异步驱动;列表将自动出现该任务。");
          return refreshRunList(token);
        })
        .catch(function (error) { show(createRunFailureText(error)); });
    });

    /* One poller: the list every 2s while auto-refresh is on and a token is
     * present; the expanded run's detail (and its WS subscriptions) ride the
     * same tick. Transient loopback errors are retried on the next tick. */
    if (workbenchState.pollTimer === null) {
      workbenchState.pollTimer = setInterval(function () {
        var token = tokenInput.value;
        if (token === "") return;
        var auto = document.getElementById("auto-refresh-toggle");
        if (auto === null || auto.checked !== true) return;
        refreshRunList(token)
          .then(function () { return refreshExpandedRun(token); })
          .catch(function () { /* next tick retries */ });
      }, 2000);
    }
  }

  /* ---- M9-03: the profiles CONFIG tab (view + atomic write-back) ----------
   * Same sanitization contract as every panel above: EVERY dynamic value
   * reaches the DOM through esc(...). The write body is built from an
   * EXPLICIT single-field allowlist ({content: full file text}); validation
   * is the EXISTING frozen ProfilesFileSchema parser server-side — a 422
   * refusal never touches the file, and a failed save NEVER re-renders the
   * panel, so the editor keeps exactly what the operator typed. A 409
   * PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT renders the honest 壳未接线/未传 --profiles
   * guidance instead of any guessed path. */

  var PROFILES_WRITE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST = ["content"];

  /* UI-layer gate for the write-back: the body is built from an EXPLICIT
   * allowlist (one field); empty/whitespace-only content is refused before
   * any network traffic (the server re-validates everything). */
  function buildProfilesFullWritePayload(fields) {
    var keys = Object.keys(fields || {});
    for (var i = 0; i < keys.length; i++) {
      if (PROFILES_WRITE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST.indexOf(keys[i]) === -1) {
        throw new Error('refused field "' + keys[i] + '": the profiles write-back accepts only content (the full file text)');
      }
    }
    var content = fields && typeof fields.content === "string" ? fields.content : "";
    if (content.trim().length === 0) {
      throw new Error("配置全文为空:写回必须携带完整文件内容(整体替换)");
    }
    return { content: content };
  }

  /* The 409 guidance (壳未接线/未传 --profiles): states the fact, the
   * downstream effect (no tasks either), and BOTH wiring paths. Static
   * content only — nothing dynamic to escape. */
  function profilesFullAbsenceHtml() {
    return '<div class="profiles-absence" role="alert">' +
      "<h3>壳未接线 / 未传 --profiles</h3>" +
      "<p>本服务进程没有 profiles 来源文件:配置接口以 409 PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT 诚实拒绝,不存在任何「猜测一个路径来写」的回退;工作台「新建任务」同样不可用(503 ORCHESTRATION_NOT_CONFIGURED)。</p>" +
      "<p>接线方式(二选一,然后重启壳/进程):</p>" +
      "<ul>" +
      '<li>桌面壳:把符合冻结 ProfilesFileSchema 的 <code>profiles.json</code> 放到 per-user 数据目录 <code>%LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\role-orchestrator\\\\profiles.json</code>(与默认库同目录;存在才由壳传给 serve 子进程,不存在则不传——serve 行为与 v0.1.1 完全一致)。</li>' +
      "<li>手动启动:<code>node serve-bin.js --db &lt;库路径&gt; --profiles &lt;profiles.json 路径&gt;</code>(严格 JSON,可由 config/profiles.example.yaml 转换)。</li>" +
      "</ul>" +
      "<p>壳只传「配置文件路径」给 serve(非令牌,令牌照旧不经手壳)。</p>" +
      "</div>";
  }

  /* The loaded config view: source path, parse state, the parsed summary
   * (CLI 映射 + 预算), and the editor. ALL dynamic values escaped. */
  function profilesFullViewHtml(view) {
    var v = view || {};
    var parts = [];
    parts.push('<p class="profiles-source">来源文件(sourcePath): <code>' + esc(v.sourcePath) + "</code></p>");
    var parseError = v.parseError === undefined ? null : v.parseError;
    var profiles = v.profiles === null || v.profiles === undefined ? [] : v.profiles;
    if (parseError !== null) {
      parts.push('<div class="profiles-parse-error" role="alert">当前文件未通过既有解析器校验(冻结 ProfilesFileSchema),暂无解析结果——可在下方编辑器修复后写回(422 拒绝时原文件不动)。解析错误: ' + esc(parseError) + "</div>");
    } else {
      parts.push('<p class="hint">解析结果(共 ' + esc(profiles.length) +
        " 个 profile;预算 = maxConcurrency 并发上限 × timeoutSeconds 杀预算):</p>");
      parts.push('<table class="profiles-summary"><thead><tr><th>id</th><th>runtime(CLI 映射)</th><th>model</th><th>maxConcurrency</th><th>timeoutSeconds</th></tr></thead><tbody>');
      for (var i = 0; i < profiles.length; i++) {
        var p = profiles[i] || {};
        parts.push("<tr><td>" + esc(p.id) + "</td><td>" + esc(p.runtime) + "</td><td>" +
          (p.model === null || p.model === undefined ? "(CLI 默认模型)" : esc(p.model)) + "</td><td>" +
          esc(p.maxConcurrency) + "</td><td>" + esc(p.timeoutSeconds) + "</td></tr>");
      }
      parts.push("</tbody></table>");
    }
    parts.push('<label for="profiles-full-editor">配置全文(写回时整体替换,经既有解析器校验后原子落盘)</label>');
    parts.push('<textarea id="profiles-full-editor" rows="16" spellcheck="false" wrap="off">' +
      esc(v.rawText === null || v.rawText === undefined ? "" : v.rawText) + "</textarea>");
    parts.push('<div class="form-row"><button id="save-profiles-full-button" type="button">校验并原子写回</button>' +
      '<span id="profiles-full-save-status" class="profiles-save-status" role="status"></span></div>');
    parts.push('<p class="hint">写回成功不热重载:运行中的进程仍使用启动时载入的 profiles,重启 serve 后生效;同 id 不同定义的 run 创建将 409(漂移是显式的人的决定)。</p>');
    return parts.join("");
  }

  /* Explicit refusal text per typed code. The 422 branch is the reassure
   * branch: the file was NOT modified. */
  function profilesSaveFailureText(error) {
    var code = error && error.code ? String(error.code) : "";
    var status = error && error.status ? Number(error.status) : 0;
    var message = error && error.message ? String(error.message) : "未知错误";
    if (status === 422) return "写回失败(422):内容未通过既有解析器校验(冻结 ProfilesFileSchema),原文件未改动,编辑器内容保留。解析错误: " + message;
    if (status === 409 && code === "PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT") return "写回失败(409):本进程没有 profiles 来源路径(壳未接线/未传 --profiles),无处写回,未改动任何文件。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 403) return "写回失败(403):守卫拒绝(令牌/CSRF)。详情: " + message;
    if (status === 400) return "写回失败(400):请求形态被拒(body 必须是 {content: 配置全文})。详情: " + message;
    return "失败" + (status ? "(HTTP " + String(status) + (code === "" ? "" : " " + code) + ")" : "") + ": " + message;
  }

  function wireConfigDom(tokenInput) {
    var loadButton = document.getElementById("load-profiles-full-button");
    var panel = document.getElementById("profiles-full-panel");
    var status = document.getElementById("profiles-full-status");
    if (loadButton === null || panel === null) return;
    var show = function (text) { if (status !== null) status.textContent = text; };

    function loadProfilesFull(token) {
      return fetchJson("/api/v1/profiles/full", token).then(function (body) {
        panel.innerHTML = profilesFullViewHtml(body);
        return body;
      });
    }

    loadButton.addEventListener("click", function () {
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      if (token === "") { show("请先输入会话令牌,再载入配置"); return; }
      show("载入配置…");
      loadProfilesFull(token)
        .then(function (body) {
          show(body.parseError === null || body.parseError === undefined
            ? "已载入配置(" + body.profiles.length + " 个 profile)"
            : "已载入文件原文,但当前解析失败——请修复后写回");
        })
        .catch(function (error) {
          if (error !== null && typeof error === "object" && error.status === 409) {
            panel.innerHTML = profilesFullAbsenceHtml();
            show("本进程没有 profiles 来源(409 PROFILE_SOURCE_ABSENT)");
          } else {
            show("失败: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
          }
        });
    });

    /* Event delegation: the panel re-renders on every load, so the save
     * handler lives on the panel. A failed save only writes the status
     * text — the editor content survives exactly as typed (422 原文保留). */
    panel.addEventListener("click", function (event) {
      var target = event.target;
      while (target !== null && target !== panel && !(target.id === "save-profiles-full-button")) {
        target = target.parentNode;
      }
      if (target === null || target === panel) return;
      var saveStatus = panel.querySelector(".profiles-save-status");
      var showSave = function (text) { if (saveStatus !== null) saveStatus.textContent = text; };
      var token = tokenInput.value;
      if (token === "") { showSave("请先输入会话令牌"); return; }
      var editor = panel.querySelector("#profiles-full-editor");
      if (editor === null) { showSave("请先载入当前配置"); return; }
      var payload;
      try {
        payload = buildProfilesFullWritePayload({ content: editor.value });
      } catch (error) {
        showSave("拒绝: " + String(error && error.message ? error.message : error));
        return;
      }
      showSave("校验中…");
      ensureCsrfToken(token)
        .then(function (csrf) { return putJson("/api/v1/profiles/full", token, csrf, payload); })
        .then(function (body) {
          showSave("已原子写回 " + body.sourcePath + "(" + body.bytesWritten + " 字节)。运行中的进程仍使用启动时载入的 profiles——重启 serve 后生效。");
          return loadProfilesFull(token);
        })
        .then(function (body) {
          show("写回后重新载入: " + (body.parseError === null || body.parseError === undefined
            ? body.profiles.length + " 个 profile"
            : "解析失败"));
        })
        .catch(function (error) { showSave(profilesSaveFailureText(error)); });
    });
  }

  var api = {
    escapeHtml: escapeHtml,
    stripAnsiEscapes: stripAnsiEscapes,
    esc: esc,
    renderEvents: renderEvents,
    renderRunDetail: renderRunDetail,
    isNodeEditable: isNodeEditable,
    buildNodeEditPayload: buildNodeEditPayload,
    computeGraphLayout: computeGraphLayout,
    renderRunGraph: renderRunGraph,
    renderNodeEditor: renderNodeEditor,
    buildExpansionRequestPayload: buildExpansionRequestPayload,
    expansionRequestFailureText: expansionRequestFailureText,
    renderExpansionPanel: renderExpansionPanel,
    renderProposalCard: renderProposalCard,
    renderExpansionCard: renderExpansionCard,
    FORBIDDEN_UI_PHRASES: FORBIDDEN_UI_PHRASES,
    DECISION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST: DECISION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST,
    buildApprovalDecisionPayload: buildApprovalDecisionPayload,
    invalidationTexts: invalidationTexts,
    renderApprovalCard: renderApprovalCard,
    renderApprovalPanel: renderApprovalPanel,
    approvalDecisionFailureText: approvalDecisionFailureText,
    verdictText: verdictText,
    renderDiffPanel: renderDiffPanel,
    renderContextPanel: renderContextPanel,
    ROLE_OPTIONS: ROLE_OPTIONS,
    EDIT_FIELD_ALLOWLIST: EDIT_FIELD_ALLOWLIST,
    EXPANSION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST: EXPANSION_FIELD_ALLOWLIST,
    /* M9-02 workbench surface */
    RUN_CREATE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST: RUN_CREATE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST,
    RUN_STATUS_GLOSS: RUN_STATUS_GLOSS,
    buildRunCreatePayload: buildRunCreatePayload,
    projectDirHint: projectDirHint,
    profileOptionsHtml: profileOptionsHtml,
    runStatusBadgeHtml: runStatusBadgeHtml,
    runRowHtml: runRowHtml,
    renderRunList: renderRunList,
    runFailureNoteHtml: runFailureNoteHtml,
    runDetailCardHtml: runDetailCardHtml,
    runDetailHtml: runDetailHtml,
    createRunFailureText: createRunFailureText,
    /* M9-03 profiles config surface */
    PROFILES_WRITE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST: PROFILES_WRITE_FIELD_ALLOWLIST,
    buildProfilesFullWritePayload: buildProfilesFullWritePayload,
    profilesFullAbsenceHtml: profilesFullAbsenceHtml,
    profilesFullViewHtml: profilesFullViewHtml,
    profilesSaveFailureText: profilesSaveFailureText
  };
  if (typeof globalThis !== "undefined") globalThis.__roleOrchestratorPage = api;
  if (typeof document !== "undefined") wireDom();
})();
`;
}

